<title>BRAZIL: Brazil brewery Brahma 1996 net higher.</title>
<headline>Brazil brewery Brahma 1996 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil brewery company Companhia Cervejaria Brahma issued the following statement on its controlling company's 1996 results.</p>
<p>			   1996			  1995</p>
<p>    shr profit	 44.45 reais		 37.39 reais</p>
<p>    net profit	 324.8 million		   257.3 million</p>
<p>    net revenue	1.49 bln		    1.21 bln</p>
<p>Note: All figures in Brazilian reais.</p>
<p>Share profit figures provided in lots of 1,000 shares.</p>
<p>((-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5415))</p>
